00:01:22,460 --> 00:01:28,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Gill Sans MT"><b><font color="#f0f2f2">I wanna rock... Rockin' my heart...</font></b></font></font>

29
00:02:02,390 --> 00:02:05,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today's... a special day, so...</font>

30
00:02:07,190 --> 00:02:08,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Time to eat!</font>

31
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:21,750
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">A</font>

32
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:21,750
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Rival?!</font>

33
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:21,750
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Sasuke and Sakura</font>

34
00:02:54,730 --> 00:02:56,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fight me, here!</font>

35
00:03:00,110 --> 00:03:02,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you doing, Konohamaru?</font>

36
00:03:03,160 --> 00:03:05,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Very good, Naruto nii-chan...</font>

37
00:03:05,450 --> 00:03:07,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're the man I expected you to be.</font>

38
00:03:10,670 --> 00:03:12,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't do anything, you know...</font>

39
00:03:13,540 --> 00:03:15,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's fight fair!</font>

40
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:18,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry! I've got
an orientation meeting to go to.</font>

41
00:03:19,550 --> 00:03:20,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An orientation meeting...?</font>

42
00:03:21,220 --> 00:03:23,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cause... As of today, I'm a Ninja!</font>

43
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:26,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

44
00:03:42,990 --> 00:03:45,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura!
Shouldn't you be heading out soon?</font>

45
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was thinking of leaving now!</font>

46
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:54,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro! How long are you planning
on treating me like a child?!</font>

47
00:03:58,380 --> 00:04:01,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right... I'm not a student
of the academy anymore...</font>

48
00:04:02,880 --> 00:04:05,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a Kunoichi of the Leaf Village,
Haruno Sakura!</font>

49
00:04:06,350 --> 00:04:07,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm off!</font>

50
00:04:15,310 --> 00:04:16,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Morning, Sakura.</font>

51
00:04:17,520 --> 00:04:18,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Morning... Ino.</font>

52
00:04:26,450 --> 00:04:29,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who would've thought you'd
be able to graduate.</font>

53
00:04:29,790 --> 00:04:31,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ancient history has nothing to do with it.</font>

54
00:04:32,120 --> 00:04:34,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As of today,
we're both full-fledged Ninja...</font>

55
00:04:35,790 --> 00:04:37,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose to you anymore, Ino!</font>

56
00:04:58,940 --> 00:05:01,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...? Why are you here?</font>

57
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:04,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today's meeting is for graduates only.</font>

58
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:09,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, don't you see this headband?</font>

59
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:12,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As of today, I'm a Ninja, too!</font>

60
00:05:14,620 --> 00:05:18,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can I put it, it really suits me.</font>

61
00:05:21,130 --> 00:05:23,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Naruto-kun... was able to graduate.</font>

62
00:05:33,470 --> 00:05:34,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Goal!</font>

63
00:05:37,440 --> 00:05:39,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won again, Sakura!</font>

64
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:40,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you saying...?</font>

65
00:05:40,570 --> 00:05:44,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The tip of my foot got in
one centimeter faster!</font>

66
00:05:44,860 --> 00:05:46,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You must be blind.</font>

67
00:05:48,110 --> 00:05:49,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Sakura-chan.</font>

68
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:54,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

69
00:05:56,290 --> 00:05:58,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan's looking at me...</font>

70
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Sakura!</font>

71
00:06:02,300 --> 00:06:04,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mor... morning, Sakura-chan...</font>

72
00:06:04,130 --> 00:06:05,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get outta' the way!</font>

73
00:06:06,590 --> 00:06:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">M-Morning, Sasuke-kun...</font>

74
00:06:12,510 --> 00:06:14,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mind if I sit next to you?</font>

75
00:06:14,930 --> 00:06:17,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! I'm going to sit
next to Sasuke-kun!</font>

76
00:06:17,810 --> 00:06:19,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First come, first served!</font>

77
00:06:19,650 --> 00:06:22,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got in the classroom sooner!</font>

78
00:06:22,820 --> 00:06:23,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did!</font>

79
00:06:23,570 --> 00:06:24,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's the case,
then I did!</font>

80
00:06:24,860 --> 00:06:25,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was first!</font>

81
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:28,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sitting next to Sasuke-kun!</font>

82
00:06:30,570 --> 00:06:31,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How annoying...</font>

83
00:06:33,370 --> 00:06:38,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that this year's top rookie,
Uchiha Sasuke?</font>

84
00:06:38,870 --> 00:06:39,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

85
00:06:41,130 --> 00:06:43,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The sole survivor of the Uchiha clan?</font>

86
00:06:44,750 --> 00:06:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

87
00:06:56,350 --> 00:06:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto, eh...</font>

88
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:14,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Don't glare at Sasuke-kun!</font>

89
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan...</font>

90
00:07:18,290 --> 00:07:20,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone's all Sasuke, Sasuke.</font>

91
00:07:21,250 --> 00:07:22,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's so great about this guy?!</font>

92
00:07:27,380 --> 00:07:29,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just beat him up, Sasuke-kun!</font>

93
00:07:29,470 --> 00:07:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! Yeah!</font>

94
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:32,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Really?</font>

95
00:07:33,050 --> 00:07:34,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Sorry!</font>

96
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?</font>

97
00:07:36,060 --> 00:07:36,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa!</font>

98
00:07:45,020 --> 00:07:51,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro! I was planning on
seizing Sasuke-kun's first kiss!</font>

99
00:07:54,370 --> 00:07:56,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk...
Naruto! I'll kill you!</font>

100
00:07:56,830 --> 00:07:58,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— My mouth is rotting.
— Huh? Was that my fault?</font>

101
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:01,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? I feel rage...</font>

102
00:08:03,580 --> 00:08:04,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

103
00:08:05,630 --> 00:08:06,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

104
00:08:07,210 --> 00:08:09,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An accident...
It was an accident</font>

105
00:08:11,380 --> 00:08:12,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are annoying!</font>

106
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:13,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yikes!</font>

107
00:08:15,050 --> 00:08:19,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... He's at
the center of trouble as usual.</font>

108
00:08:20,770 --> 00:08:25,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As of today, you all have become
full-fledged Ninja...</font>

109
00:08:26,060 --> 00:08:28,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, you're still Genin.</font>

110
00:08:29,070 --> 00:08:31,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The tough part's still to come!</font>

111
00:08:32,030 --> 00:08:34,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here on, you'll be in a team of three</font>

112
00:08:34,950 --> 00:08:38,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and carry out your missions
under your Jonin teachers.</font>

113
00:08:40,910 --> 00:08:42,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A team of three?!</font>

114
00:08:42,660 --> 00:08:45,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder who's going to be
grouped with Sasuke-kun.</font>

115
00:08:47,130 --> 00:08:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know...</font>

116
00:08:49,630 --> 00:08:53,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro! I'll be the one grouped
with Sasuke-kun, naturally!</font>

117
00:08:55,970 --> 00:09:00,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Teams of three, eh.
It'll just slow me down...</font>

118
00:09:01,310 --> 00:09:02,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First will be Sakura-chan.</font>

119
00:09:03,020 --> 00:09:04,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the other person...</font>

120
00:09:05,560 --> 00:09:07,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">can be anyone other than Sasuke!</font>

121
00:09:08,230 --> 00:09:09,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The teams have been determined</font>

122
00:09:10,020 --> 00:09:12,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so that the strength of
the teams will be balanced.</font>

123
00:09:13,610 --> 00:09:15,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now for the assignments!</font>

124
00:09:18,740 --> 00:09:20,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, next is Team 7...</font>

125
00:09:20,700 --> 00:09:21,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

126
00:09:23,410 --> 00:09:24,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Haruno Sakura.</font>

127
00:09:26,330 --> 00:09:27,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hooray!</font>

128
00:09:27,750 --> 00:09:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm with... Naruto...?</font>

129
00:09:30,130 --> 00:09:31,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... Uchiha Sasuke!</font>

130
00:09:32,170 --> 00:09:33,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hooray!</font>

131
00:09:33,840 --> 00:09:35,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm with... Sasuke...?</font>

132
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I'll be in a different team
from Naruto-kun, huh...</font>

133
00:09:43,100 --> 00:09:45,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next is Team 8. Hyuga Hinata!</font>

134
00:09:45,640 --> 00:09:47,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes...</font>

135
00:09:48,020 --> 00:09:49,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inuzuka Kiba!</font>

136
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aburame Shino!</font>

137
00:09:56,490 --> 00:09:57,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is this happening...?</font>

138
00:09:58,610 --> 00:09:59,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Team 9.</font>

139
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:01,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro! Love will be victorious!</font>

140
00:10:02,950 --> 00:10:03,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man...</font>

141
00:10:04,330 --> 00:10:07,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do women think that
kind of guy's so great...?</font>

142
00:10:08,420 --> 00:10:11,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you understand, Shikamaru?</font>

143
00:10:12,290 --> 00:10:14,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I'm not a woman...</font>

144
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:18,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why you are
not popular among girls.</font>

145
00:10:19,180 --> 00:10:22,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wouldn't want to be grouped with you.</font>

146
00:10:23,350 --> 00:10:28,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Team 10. Yamanaka Ino.
Nara Shikamaru.</font>

147
00:10:29,190 --> 00:10:31,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears we've been
grouped together.</font>

148
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:35,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Akimichi Choji.</font>

149
00:10:39,660 --> 00:10:41,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Fatty on top of that...</font>

150
00:10:44,290 --> 00:10:45,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's all for the team division.</font>

151
00:10:45,370 --> 00:10:46,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Iruka-sensei!</font>

152
00:10:47,330 --> 00:10:48,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why does an exceptional student
like me have to be</font>

153
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:51,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in the same team with this guy?!</font>

154
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:55,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke has the best grades
of the graduates.</font>

155
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:58,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, you're at the bottom!</font>

156
00:10:59,590 --> 00:11:03,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course, this is how it is when trying
to balance the strength within teams.</font>

157
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:07,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just don't get in my way, loser.</font>

158
00:11:09,520 --> 00:11:10,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what did you say?!</font>

159
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:11,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You want to fight, loser?</font>

160
00:11:13,060 --> 00:11:14,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knock it off, Naruto!!</font>

161
00:11:16,820 --> 00:11:19,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the afternoon,
I'll introduce you to your Jonin teachers.</font>

162
00:11:19,530 --> 00:11:20,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're dismissed until then!</font>

163
00:11:22,450 --> 00:11:23,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

164
00:11:24,330 --> 00:11:26,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did you go, Sasuke-kun?</font>

165
00:11:27,450 --> 00:11:32,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought since we're in the same team
and all, we'd eat together.</font>

166
00:11:32,330 --> 00:11:33,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chaaan!</font>

167
00:11:34,290 --> 00:11:38,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since we're in the same team and all,
let's eat together!</font>

168
00:11:38,550 --> 00:11:41,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why should I have to eat with you?!</font>

169
00:11:42,090 --> 00:11:44,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... we're in the same team, so...</font>

170
00:11:45,300 --> 00:11:47,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... annoying.</font>

171
00:11:50,140 --> 00:11:52,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun! Where are you?</font>

172
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:02,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! This is no fun.</font>

173
00:12:02,700 --> 00:12:05,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm finally in the same team as Sakura-chan...
and then it's like this...</font>

174
00:12:06,450 --> 00:12:08,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if something good will happen...</font>

175
00:12:18,300 --> 00:12:18,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it!</font>

176
00:12:28,310 --> 00:12:29,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen up!</font>

177
00:12:29,220 --> 00:12:33,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as we're in the same team,
you will follow my instructions.</font>

178
00:12:33,690 --> 00:12:34,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, yeah...</font>

179
00:12:36,020 --> 00:12:39,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She becomes a real pain in the neck
when people try to argue with to her, so...</font>

180
00:12:39,690 --> 00:12:42,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's all go out for
some BBQ sometime.</font>

181
00:12:42,110 --> 00:12:42,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, man...</font>

182
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:44,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

183
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...?</font>

184
00:12:50,160 --> 00:12:50,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

185
00:12:53,830 --> 00:12:54,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

186
00:12:56,420 --> 00:12:57,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jerk, it's Naruto, isn't it?!</font>

187
00:12:57,750 --> 00:12:59,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! Just be quiet.</font>

188
00:12:59,800 --> 00:13:03,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! I won't forgive you
if you hurt Sasuke-kun!</font>

189
00:13:11,810 --> 00:13:12,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?</font>

190
00:13:17,020 --> 00:13:18,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh! Idiot...</font>

191
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:27,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So Naruto got beaten by
the one he challenged...</font>

192
00:13:28,950 --> 00:13:33,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course! Naruto's no match
for Sasuke-kun!</font>

193
00:13:37,120 --> 00:13:38,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No need for me to feel rushed...</font>

194
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here on out,</font>

195
00:13:40,170 --> 00:13:42,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be in the same team as
Sasuke-kun for the long haul...</font>

196
00:13:43,920 --> 00:13:44,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

197
00:13:49,470 --> 00:13:51,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if I were to use
my feminine charms...</font>

198
00:13:51,350 --> 00:13:53,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my proportions are below average...</font>

199
00:13:53,970 --> 00:13:56,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All that's above average is
the width of my forehead...</font>

200
00:13:57,230 --> 00:13:58,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should I do...?</font>

201
00:14:02,690 --> 00:14:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? No way!</font>

202
00:14:04,860 --> 00:14:05,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... is looking...</font>

203
00:14:05,820 --> 00:14:06,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this way!</font>

204
00:14:09,820 --> 00:14:11,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And with such a passionate look!</font>

205
00:14:13,330 --> 00:14:16,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... have a charmingly wide forehead.</font>

206
00:14:17,620 --> 00:14:20,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It makes me want to kiss it.</font>

207
00:14:21,000 --> 00:14:23,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what its surface area is for.</font>

208
00:14:25,090 --> 00:14:26,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, right...</font>

209
00:14:27,090 --> 00:14:29,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not just some kid
who believes in fairy tales...</font>

210
00:14:30,090 --> 00:14:31,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way.</font>

211
00:14:32,100 --> 00:14:35,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... have a charmingly wide forehead.</font>

212
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:36,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

213
00:14:38,390 --> 00:14:40,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It makes me want to kiss it.</font>

214
00:14:47,740 --> 00:14:50,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro! This fairy tale is for real!!</font>

215
00:14:51,780 --> 00:14:55,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or that's what Naruto would say.</font>

216
00:14:57,330 --> 00:14:59,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got something to ask you.</font>

217
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:00,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

218
00:15:01,670 --> 00:15:04,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think... of Naruto?</font>

219
00:15:06,710 --> 00:15:13,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's quite at home interfering and
enjoys it when I make mistakes.</font>

220
00:15:14,140 --> 00:15:17,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto doesn't understand
one thing about me...</font>

221
00:15:20,140 --> 00:15:21,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He just annoys me!</font>

222
00:15:22,150 --> 00:15:26,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All I want... is for you to
accept me, Sasuke-kun...</font>

223
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:30,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For me to accept you...?</font>

224
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:35,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do anything for the sake of that.</font>

225
00:15:46,800 --> 00:15:47,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was careless!</font>

226
00:15:56,260 --> 00:15:56,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wha...?!</font>

227
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:00,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gotcha!</font>

228
00:16:04,270 --> 00:16:06,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think someone who couldn't
perform the Clone Jutsu properly</font>

229
00:16:07,150 --> 00:16:10,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">could do the Shadow Clone Jutsu.</font>

230
00:16:15,030 --> 00:16:17,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... desperate, so...</font>

231
00:16:18,950 --> 00:16:20,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally know why I...</font>

232
00:16:22,370 --> 00:16:25,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I like Sakura-chan so much.</font>

233
00:16:30,090 --> 00:16:31,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Diarrhea at a time like this?!</font>

234
00:16:34,340 --> 00:16:35,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong?</font>

235
00:16:36,220 --> 00:16:37,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'll be right back...</font>

236
00:16:39,140 --> 00:16:41,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun's so shy!</font>

237
00:16:42,730 --> 00:16:44,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess he needs to
prepare himself mentally...</font>

238
00:16:51,400 --> 00:16:52,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was close!</font>

239
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:56,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My stomach hurt so much that
the Jutsu was about to wear off!</font>

240
00:16:57,410 --> 00:17:00,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why does my stomach have
to hurt at such a good time?!</font>

241
00:17:03,210 --> 00:17:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm annoying... huh...</font>

242
00:17:05,500 --> 00:17:07,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She said so again...</font>

243
00:17:07,830 --> 00:17:11,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I transformed into Sasuke and
had got a little closer to Sakura-chan...</font>

244
00:17:13,090 --> 00:17:16,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case...
I'll play an obnoxious Sasuke...</font>

245
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:19,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and make her hate him!</font>

246
00:17:25,270 --> 00:17:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Sasuke-kun,
you're such a shy bad boy!</font>

247
00:17:30,190 --> 00:17:34,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you prepared? I'm raring to go!</font>

248
00:17:35,450 --> 00:17:37,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey, Sasuke-kun!</font>

249
00:17:40,030 --> 00:17:40,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's Naruto?</font>

250
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:43,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, there you go changing
the subject again...</font>

251
00:17:44,120 --> 00:17:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just leave Naruto alone!</font>

252
00:17:47,080 --> 00:17:49,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All he does is pick fights with you!</font>

253
00:17:49,960 --> 00:17:53,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's because he wasn't raised right!</font>

254
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:54,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know!</font>

255
00:17:54,800 --> 00:17:56,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He doesn't have any parents, right?</font>

256
00:17:57,930 --> 00:18:00,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He always selfishly does
whatever he wants!</font>

257
00:18:00,550 --> 00:18:04,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My parents would get mad at me
if I did something like that!</font>

258
00:18:05,140 --> 00:18:08,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are no parents to nag you
if it's just you alone!</font>

259
00:18:09,310 --> 00:18:11,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So his selfishness comes
out at various times!</font>

260
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:14,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— The loneliness.
— Huh?</font>

261
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:19,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's something worse than getting
scolded by parents and...</font>

262
00:18:21,070 --> 00:18:22,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's gotten into you...?</font>

263
00:18:24,370 --> 00:18:25,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

264
00:18:25,250 --> 00:18:26,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">annoy me.</font>

265
00:18:37,470 --> 00:18:40,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! It finally stopped!</font>

266
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:43,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if Sakura-chan's still waiting.</font>

267
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:52,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What are you doing here?!</font>

268
00:18:52,690 --> 00:18:56,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I used the Escape Jutsu,
the very basic of techniques.</font>

269
00:18:56,990 --> 00:18:57,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

270
00:18:57,780 --> 00:18:59,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What were you planning to do...</font>

271
00:18:59,070 --> 00:19:00,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by transforming into me?!</font>

272
00:19:00,410 --> 00:19:03,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought it'd be fun, so I gave it a try!</font>

273
00:19:08,460 --> 00:19:10,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Shadow Clone Jutsu again?!</font>

274
00:19:10,290 --> 00:19:12,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll show you that I'm really amazing!</font>

275
00:19:12,290 --> 00:19:13,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll defeat you...</font>

276
00:19:13,710 --> 00:19:15,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and make you accept me!</font>

277
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:18,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prepare yourself, Sasuke!</font>

278
00:19:23,390 --> 00:19:24,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just like that, my stomach again...</font>

279
00:19:26,310 --> 00:19:27,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-Bathroom!</font>

280
00:19:29,600 --> 00:19:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm first!</font>

281
00:19:30,850 --> 00:19:31,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm first.</font>

282
00:19:31,600 --> 00:19:33,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm about to go in my pants!</font>

283
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:37,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How stupid!</font>

284
00:19:40,700 --> 00:19:42,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">"You annoy me"... huh?</font>

285
00:19:43,490 --> 00:19:47,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see. So this is how
Naruto must've felt...</font>

286
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:53,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if I can...
be a bit nicer next time...</font>

287
00:19:54,750 --> 00:19:56,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn.</font>

288
00:19:56,420 --> 00:19:58,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did I eat something bad?</font>

289
00:19:59,420 --> 00:20:00,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

290
00:20:02,220 --> 00:20:03,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Smile... Smile...</font>

291
00:20:05,390 --> 00:20:07,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go back to the classroom, Naruto.</font>

292
00:20:08,310 --> 00:20:09,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan...</font>

293
00:20:11,940 --> 00:20:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Payback for earlier, huh?</font>

294
00:20:13,900 --> 00:20:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke's turned himself into Sakura-chan...</font>

295
00:20:17,070 --> 00:20:19,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're trying to trick me, right, Sasuke?!</font>

296
00:20:19,530 --> 00:20:20,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't think so!</font>

297
00:20:24,410 --> 00:20:27,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ow, ow, ow...
What the heck is going on?!</font>

298
00:20:28,950 --> 00:20:29,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

299
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:35,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot, Naruto!</font>

300
00:20:40,920 --> 00:20:42,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, this is Naruto's room...</font>

301
00:20:43,700 --> 00:20:47,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And Sasuke of the Uchiha clan is
also in the team you'll be in charge of.</font>

302
00:20:48,010 --> 00:20:49,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wish you good luck!</font>

303
00:20:53,940 --> 00:20:55,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The expiration date...</font>

304
00:20:56,060 --> 00:20:58,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of this milk has passed quite awhile ago...</font>

305
00:21:00,650 --> 00:21:03,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll get sick if he drinks this.</font>

306
00:21:04,490 --> 00:21:06,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like things are
going to get disastrous.</font>

